abstract: >-
  Exact C17/OpenMP arithmetic-derivative enumeration, canonical nine-term
  indexed and documentary tables, independent finite Python arithmetic and
  record verification, and an English monolithic manuscript for OEIS A249110.
  New recorded coverage runs from 823544 through 22000000000 inclusive.
  Consecutive indexing depends on the inherited five-term baseline and the
  sole producer's complete saved records and finite-domain primality premises;
  the positive checks do not independently repeat the negative census.
  Includes the monolithic LaTeX manuscript and matching PDF. The DOI refers
  to the Zenodo release series; the package version is v1.0.1.
keywords:
